# Cosmogoyf counts "the number of cards you own in exile". A prepared permanent's prepare spell is a copy of a card in exile, not
# a card (CR 722.3, 707.12), so it is not counted. On turn 3 Bot1's Paradox Shaper becomes prepared in the upkeep, and Omit
# Variables, its copy, waits in exile; Bot1 owns no card there, so Cosmogoyf stays 0/1. Once the copy is cast and leaves exile,
# Cosmogoyf is still 0/1: nothing it counts has changed.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Paradox Shaper
Cosmogoyf
Black Lotus
Island
Island x30

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x30

